WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760
In 1967, a historian named Lynn
White made a startling claim.

2
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:11.220
He argued that one way of reading the Bible
had helped cause the ecological crisis.

3
00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.810
The key word is dominion.

4
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.630
Genesis tells humans: fill
the earth, and subdue it.

5
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.520
Have dominion.

6
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:24.060
So if God told humans to rule the earth,
does that mean they can use it however

7
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.290
they like?

8
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.570
In this mission, you'll find out what
Christians mean by humans being made in

9
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.140
the image of God.

10
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.170
Then you'll read three
short verses from Genesis,

11
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.310
and compare what each one asks of humans.

12
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:41.950
Your mission: work out what ruling
the earth really means for Christians.
